# Smart Calling App

The umbrella product for the UK African diaspora: cheap calls, airtime
top-up, and (later) remittance under one roof. This repo currently ships
**feature one — the Telegram-native airtime/data top-up bot**, which is
the front door *and* your first real margin. Built on the same Oracle
Cloud + Telegram + CI/CD stack as King Bot.

Roadmap inside this repo:
- ✅ **Layer 1 — Airtime/data top-up** (this build): light regulation, real margin, no FCA licence.
- ⏳ **Layer 0 — Calls**: the brand's namesake, slots in once you have users.
- ⏳ **Layer 2 — Remittance**: via an agent-of-a-licensed-PI or RaaS partner.
- ⏳ **Layer 3 — Wallets / Family Vaults**: EMI territory, the endgame.

## How the money works

Customer picks a send value (what the recipient receives) → you charge
that value **plus a markup** (default 12%) → the difference is your gross
margin, logged per transaction. No stored customer balance, so this layer
stays out of e-money / EMI regulation. Payment is always collected
**before** the top-up fires (see `payments.py`).

```
Recipient gets £5.00 airtime
Customer pays   £5.60   (12% markup)
Your margin     £0.60
```

